Initialize Parking Lot
1. POST http://localhost:3000/api/slots/initialize
Body → raw → JSON:
json{
  "totalSlots": 10
}

2️ .Get All Slots
GET http://localhost:3000/api/slots

3. Get Available Slots
GET http://localhost:3000/api/slots?status=available

4️. Vehicle Entry — Car 1
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/entry
json{
  "numberPlate": "MH12AB1234"
}

5️. Vehicle Entry — Car 2
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/entry
json{
  "numberPlate": "KA05CD5678"
}

6️. Vehicle Entry — Car 3
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/entry
json{
  "numberPlate": "DL01EF9999"
}

7️. Try Duplicate Entry (should give 409 error — shows validation works)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/entry
json{
  "numberPlate": "MH12AB1234"
}

8️.Get Occupied Slots
GET http://localhost:3000/api/slots?status=occupied

9️. Get All Currently Parked Vehicles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles

10.Search Vehicle by Number Plate
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/MH12AB1234

11 .Get Specific Slot
GET http://localhost:3000/api/slots/1

12.  Vehicle Exit
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehicles/exit
json{
  "numberPlate": "MH12AB1234"
}

1️3.  Get Parking History
GET http://localhost:3000/api/history

14. Get History - EXITED only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/history?status=EXITED

1️5. Reset Parking Lot
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/slots/reset